OL,3,AMajor US storms snarl air travel as
OL,4,Amore than 900,000 left in the dark on
OL,5,AThanksgiving holiday
OL,6,
OL,7,FMajor storms bring severe weather to
OL,8,Fboth US coasts, causing power cuts and
OL,9,Fflight cancellations as the country
OL,10,Fcelebrates Thanksgiving
OL,12,FHundreds of flights have been
OL,13,Fcancelled, with more than 1,000
OL,14,Fdelayed, meanwhile more than 900,000
OL,15,Fcustomers are without power
OL,17,FIt comes as more than 80 million people
OL,18,Fare expected to travel over the holiday
OL,19,Fweekend - Transportation Secretary Sean
OL,20,FDuffy calls it "the Super Bowl of US
OL,21,Fair travel"
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
